  "validity_notes": [
    "V1-SUBSTRATE: deterministic, stdlib-only, credential-free; two loopback HTTP oracles on 127.0.0.1 ephemeral ports; no external network, no model calls, no tokens.",
    "V3-CARRIER-IMMUTABLE: src/spider/kernel.py was not modified by this packet; it remains sha256 3a6caf970f5c86db19419f7ae57c7125f409eceba922eb2d5a9f5964140bb1b3 (verified before and after).",
    "V6-DETERMINISM: the only timing-dependent quantity M-T-GROW-LATENCY-MS is excluded from the determinism equality projection by construction.",
    "V10-REPRESENTATION-LIMITS: results bound THIS synthetic eight-family declared-grammar bank, THIS fixed seeded probe space (lengths 1-4 over '0123456789abcdef', PROBE_BUDGET=256), and THIS carrier; they are NOT an end-to-end external-agent measurement, NOT a general soundness proof, and NOT a product-economics measurement.",
    "The zero-false-accept claim is within-envelope by frozen construction: WITHIN_ENVELOPE excludes H7. H7 is the deliberately reachable closed-world boundary (allowlisted origin, certificate-admitted, over-accept outside the probe alphabet) and records 3 false accepts. The safety result is therefore conditional on the allowlist AND on the probing procedure's reachable token space covering the declaration's over-accepts.",
    "The provenance gate is live and necessary on this bank (H8 refused by origin while A-GROW-NO-PROV false-accepts H8 3/3); no closed-world widening is licensed by the certificate alone.",
    "The drift probe is decoupled and non-gating; it measures staleness behaviour (stale certificate false-accepts after grammar drift, re-mining restores zero) but does not by itself establish a maintenance-cost model.",
    "Cost figures are loopback HTTP counts and wall-clock growth latency only; they do not include real-world provenance/allowlist administration, negative-bank acquisition, or model/token economics.",
    "M-T-COVERAGE is compared same-bank against M-B-SHIPPED-COVERAGE (14/30); the absolute 0.6750 constant is the parent's historical shipped-coverage anchor on the frozen seven-family bank and is retained only as an additional clearance check."
  ],
